    "All four original-bound C4 selections in these two diagnostic cohorts fail; all fourteen returned producer errors remain ambiguous deadline failures. The exact 528-message drain is not reached.",
    "The controller/routing trace does not identify an extended controller queue or routing/backoff wait after dispatch; commands are captured with a reduced remaining RPC window.",
    "The ingress trace identifies time in the local FIFO followed by command service, with four additional fresh sequence observations after earlier failures cleared the one-use successor hint. Four inherited-hint calls also fail; eliminating the fallback query alone is not established as a repair.",
    "All four checkpoint proof scopes dropped by these cohorts begin after the load failure entered cleanup. Reconciliation returns repeatedly without the expected exact version. Their shutdown lifetime does not establish a steady-state mailbox or checkpoint scheduling defect, nor successful proof latency. Producer retirement still requires exact proof, a valid newer-term resolution or joined closure.",
    "Reduce measured service/image work and FIFO interference with a deterministic matched regression before a production change. Preserve positive-receipt handoff, fresh-quorum consumed-other proof, original 3,000/5,000-ms deadlines and resource banks."
